%%HP: T(3)A(D)F(.);
\<<
  IFERR
    IF 2 SAME
    THEN STD RAD
'PPAR' PURGE ERASE
PICT (-3,3) \165.P1
REPL (-6.5,3.2)
PVIEW -6.5 4.8
      FOR X X X COS
2 ^ 4 * 1 - R\->C
PICT SWAP \165.P2 REPL
.1
      STEP -6.5 6.5
      FOR X X -1.7
R\->C PICT SWAP \165.P3
REPL .3
      STEP 6.5 -6.5
      FOR X X X COS
2 ^ 5 * 2 - R\->C
PICT SWAP \165.P4 REPL
-.2
      STEP 3 WAIT
ERASE -3 3
      FOR Y -3 Y
R\->C PICT SWAP \165.P1
REPL .1
      STEP 3 FREEZE
DEG
    END
  THEN BAD
  END
\>>
